            </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm border-l-4 border-purple-500 transition-transform hover:scale-105">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-gray-500 mb-1">จำนวนธุรกรรมวันนี้</p>
